## Onion Architecture — Layer Rules

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│           Presentation (WPF)            │  ← depends on Application + Infrastructure (DI only)
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│            Infrastructure               │  ← depends on Application + Domain
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│             Application                 │  ← depends on Domain + Common
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│               Domain                    │  ← depends on Common only
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│               Common                    │  ← depends on NOTHING
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

> **Never violate the dependency direction.** If you feel the need to, re-read `openspec/specs/architecture/architecture-rules.md` first.

## Development Workflow

1. **Discover** — `/discover` to explore and shape ideas
2. **Plan** — `/plan` to create a DDD-compliant proposal
3. **Implement** — `/implement` to scaffold and build inside-out (Domain → Application → Infrastructure → Presentation)
4. **Troubleshoot** — `/troubleshoot` when something breaks
